{"2518930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Your World - MMO Playtest", "steam_appid": 2518930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/653582a73f5d2ece1c301d5a5a5c604b.avif?t=1779231290\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your World is a sandbox world creator, online party game, and multiplayer social platform that allows hundreds of players to jump into user-created worlds and theme parks loaded with rides, activities, and fun mini-games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight years in the making, Your World is our greatest labor of love.  Using the easy-to-use editor, players can build amazing worlds featuring fun gameplay, then open their worlds for the community to enjoy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/44929a468ab82f182193c2812a6d52a8.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 mini-game styles, including competitive racing, flying challenges, shooters, side-scrollers, platforming, and interactive game challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/839671cf8370afe944cfe275cb7660cd.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/839671cf8370afe944cfe275cb7660cd.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/839671cf8370afe944cfe275cb7660cd.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/616cc976f3c640bece7c3688a30316c2.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer amusement parks with rideable steel and wooden coasters, plus rideable flat rides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/91895cd232cb68482230a9995c125a04.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/91895cd232cb68482230a9995c125a04.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/91895cd232cb68482230a9995c125a04.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/6a4410b0b7da9bac494559ff1a8d2dba.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your World's custom server allows 1000 live players in each world instance and tens of thousands across multiple servers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/2f64a7e9870817823c1005e9ab542036.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/2f64a7e9870817823c1005e9ab542036.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/2f64a7e9870817823c1005e9ab542036.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/8ce622f2af7c350724d124c1d237798a.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avatar's mouth shape matches your speech in real-time. Character AI adjusts to your environment and voice expression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/7bfc7b3289f20a99148371b6e7134d29.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/7bfc7b3289f20a99148371b6e7134d29.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/7bfc7b3289f20a99148371b6e7134d29.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/fbf95bfbae982626dfb009070b32c90e.avif?t=1779231290\" width=694 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your World's custom editor and expansive library includes 40 game templates and over 2000 assets. Players can create a fully immersive social experience where other gamers can play games, compete, and hang out with friends.  Here are just some of the editor's features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/8aca0d732547d130d398f78a36c79fb1.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ProGem's powerful World Painter toolset makes world-building quick and easy.  World Painter features include: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Scenery Painter&quot; for easy construction of plazas, streets, and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Event Builder&quot; for quickly creating fun mini-games and live events.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;World Painter&quot; for fast global decorating of scenery and nature elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/0dc656fbfb740bb6321c76dd4b4fb850.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/0dc656fbfb740bb6321c76dd4b4fb850.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/0dc656fbfb740bb6321c76dd4b4fb850.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/3c45f1725d2a8e778cbf99b6e9f733b0.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/3c45f1725d2a8e778cbf99b6e9f733b0.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/3c45f1725d2a8e778cbf99b6e9f733b0.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/377e49a41db13f86c4ce17aa9d6c640f.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece-by-piece tools with a quick snap feature for building custom scenery you can copy/paste or upload to the workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/e1227b7f08be5e1e06da86428eb22979.avif?t=1779231290\" width=800 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/6532a99d945cfa9cbdd65f26d269745d.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxel terrain generator and sculpting.  Add hills,  dig tunnels, or drop entire voxel terrains with a single click.  Terrain automatically molds around your scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/a2ea5265e85ef5cc0f70f7e250b5ed97.avif?t=1779231290\" width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/d92bf967947a4b816ea9e805942cdb8d.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***** Additional Gameplay Features *****</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Avatars:  Change clothing, hairstyle, facial features, and apparel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom apparel shops, vehicle rental, and inventory systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Shows: Fireworks and synchronized light &amp; fountain shows.  All live! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Concerts:  Real-time dual video streams to 2 massive outdoor displays for live performances, shows, and awards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host Controller:  Open &amp; close your park,  private sky-view mode,  talk to your guests over the park intercom,  text guests privately or globally,  set time of day, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards:  Massive outdoor LED leaderboards for player competitions and rewards.  ​ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamed music and videos throughout the parks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 2000 assets, 60 libraries, and 40 mini-game style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> ***** Additional Editor Features ***** </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix-n-match environment, character, material, nature, and scenery libraries to create your custom world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful path editor with click-n-drag paths, stencils, intersections, and our unique on-the-fly construction, where you drive a steamroller and the path is built in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foliage painting tools place nature elements around paths and scenery, allowing you to add grass, flowers, rocks, and trees in a single stroke.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtest your game in the editor to fine-tune gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and publish your world to the network for other games to enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amusement park plugin for multiplayer rideable coasters and carnival rides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Your World plugin for Unreal Engine 5.5 for custom asset development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/653582a73f5d2ece1c301d5a5a5c604b.avif?t=1779231290\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your World is a sandbox world creator, online party game, and multiplayer social platform that allows hundreds of players to jump into user-created worlds and theme parks loaded with rides, activities, and fun mini-games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight years in the making, Your World is our greatest labor of love.  Using the easy-to-use editor, players can build amazing worlds featuring fun gameplay, then open their worlds for the community to enjoy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/44929a468ab82f182193c2812a6d52a8.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 mini-game styles, including competitive racing, flying challenges, shooters, side-scrollers, platforming, and interactive game challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/839671cf8370afe944cfe275cb7660cd.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/839671cf8370afe9