extras/2f64a7e9870817823c1005e9ab542036.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/2f64a7e9870817823c1005e9ab542036.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/2f64a7e9870817823c1005e9ab542036.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/8ce622f2af7c350724d124c1d237798a.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avatar's mouth shape matches your speech in real-time. Character AI adjusts to your environment and voice expression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/7bfc7b3289f20a99148371b6e7134d29.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/7bfc7b3289f20a99148371b6e7134d29.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/7bfc7b3289f20a99148371b6e7134d29.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/fbf95bfbae982626dfb009070b32c90e.avif?t=1779231290\" width=694 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your World's custom editor and expansive library includes 40 game templates and over 2000 assets. Players can create a fully immersive social experience where other gamers can play games, compete, and hang out with friends.  Here are just some of the editor's features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/8aca0d732547d130d398f78a36c79fb1.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ProGem's powerful World Painter toolset makes world-building quick and easy.  World Painter features include: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Scenery Painter&quot; for easy construction of plazas, streets, and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Event Builder&quot; for quickly creating fun mini-games and live events.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;World Painter&quot; for fast global decorating of scenery and nature elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/0dc656fbfb740bb6321c76dd4b4fb850.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/0dc656fbfb740bb6321c76dd4b4fb850.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/0dc656fbfb740bb6321c76dd4b4fb850.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/3c45f1725d2a8e778cbf99b6e9f733b0.poster.avif?t=1779231290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/3c45f1725d2a8e778cbf99b6e9f733b0.webm?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/3c45f1725d2a8e778cbf99b6e9f733b0.mp4?t=1779231290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/377e49a41db13f86c4ce17aa9d6c640f.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece-by-piece tools with a quick snap feature for building custom scenery you can copy/paste or upload to the workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/e1227b7f08be5e1e06da86428eb22979.avif?t=1779231290\" width=800 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/6532a99d945cfa9cbdd65f26d269745d.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxel terrain generator and sculpting.  Add hills,  dig tunnels, or drop entire voxel terrains with a single click.  Terrain automatically molds around your scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/a2ea5265e85ef5cc0f70f7e250b5ed97.avif?t=1779231290\" width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/extras/d92bf967947a4b816ea9e805942cdb8d.webp?t=1779231290\" width=695 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***** Additional Gameplay Features *****</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Avatars:  Change clothing, hairstyle, facial features, and apparel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom apparel shops, vehicle rental, and inventory systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Shows: Fireworks and synchronized light &amp; fountain shows.  All live! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Concerts:  Real-time dual video streams to 2 massive outdoor displays for live performances, shows, and awards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host Controller:  Open &amp; close your park,  private sky-view mode,  talk to your guests over the park intercom,  text guests privately or globally,  set time of day, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards:  Massive outdoor LED leaderboards for player competitions and rewards.  ​ </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamed music and videos throughout the parks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 2000 assets, 60 libraries, and 40 mini-game style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> ***** Additional Editor Features ***** </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix-n-match environment, character, material, nature, and scenery libraries to create your custom world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful path editor with click-n-drag paths, stencils, intersections, and our unique on-the-fly construction, where you drive a steamroller and the path is built in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foliage painting tools place nature elements around paths and scenery, allowing you to add grass, flowers, rocks, and trees in a single stroke.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtest your game in the editor to fine-tune gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and publish your world to the network for other games to enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amusement park plugin for multiplayer rideable coasters and carnival rides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Your World plugin for Unreal Engine 5.5 for custom asset development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Your World is a sandbox world creator, online party game, and multiplayer social platform that allows hundreds of players to jump into user-created worlds and theme parks loaded with rides, activities, and fun mini-games.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Full of breathtaking visuals and unique attractions...Playing Imagineer is fun, and seeing the creative ideas others come up with is equally exciting.”<br>MiceChat<br><br>“Merging the power of Unreal Engine with Pantera’s own proprietary technology, this platform is not just another digital space but a vibrant, immersive 3D social environment….The array of features in Your World is as diverse as it is impressive. Players can engage in an eclectic mix of activities—from racing and flight simulations to experiencing live concerts and platforming adventures.”<br>Gaming Lyfe<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/2f94a2861c3d1191e1a13a8c435de07db67d5015/header.jpg?t=1779231290", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518930/98232